        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p><p>“<strong>John Bartleby</strong>” is an attorney and author based in Newport Beach, California. Although he never played Little League, he is a lifelong Atlanta Braves fan. Out of allegiance to his team, he will not consider John Smoltz’s apocryphal ironing incident for the subject matter of his next story.</p>
